            <ArticleTitle>Reiki therapy: the benefits to a nurse/Reiki practitioner.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>209-17</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study evaluates how nurses who gave Reiki therapy perceived the benefit of this therapy on their clients and on themselves concurrently as providers of the therapy. As an adjunct, the study's purpose was to enhance the understanding and credibility of nurse/Reiki practitioners.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
